---
name: diff
description: The smallest patch (a diff, not a file)
invokable: true
---
Suggest the SMALLEST change that moves me forward, as a unified diff only (--- / +++ / @@).
Do not rewrite the whole file; stay within ~15 changed lines and this lab's allowed
concepts. Then for each changed block: what changed, why, which embedded concept. End with
what to MEASURE to confirm it, and one check question.
